WEBVTT

00:04:33.010 --> 00:04:36.010
Bara-Suishou

00:04:36.370 --> 00:04:38.460
That's what we determined.

00:04:38.460 --> 00:04:40.080
Plants are living things.

00:04:40.250 --> 00:04:41.580
Even during summer break,

00:04:41.580 --> 00:04:45.610
don't forgetyour days on duty
and make sure to come in.

00:04:46.010 --> 00:04:46.620
Next,

00:04:47.070 --> 00:04:52.100
we've received commendations for the
track and swim teams' ward meets last month.

00:04:52.100 --> 00:04:54.520
Please come and get them if you won one.

00:04:55.510 --> 00:04:56.630
Mai Kitagawa.

00:04:57.120 --> 00:04:58.580
Toshihiro Ohba.

00:04:58.920 --> 00:05:00.840
Tetsuya Suzuki.

00:05:05.340 --> 00:05:08.840
Kami-idoya Second
Middle School

00:05:05.710 --> 00:05:06.620
Bye-bye.

00:05:06.620 --> 00:05:07.680
Bye-bye.

00:05:21.860 --> 00:05:23.900
Let's see...

00:05:26.520 --> 00:05:31.370
It's y = 2/3x - 6, so...

00:05:31.370 --> 00:05:34.870
First Term Final Exam
Practice Problems

00:05:37.980 --> 00:05:39.060
Notes.

00:05:39.410 --> 00:05:41.480
That's everything from the first term.

00:05:42.150 --> 00:05:43.440
Thank you.

00:05:46.430 --> 00:05:47.680
Also...

00:05:47.910 --> 00:05:49.980
This is the summer-break homework.

00:05:57.120 --> 00:05:58.840
D-Don't look.

00:06:00.420 --> 00:06:01.460
Later.

00:06:01.990 --> 00:06:03.000
Sure.

00:06:16.230 --> 00:06:17.080
I'm home.

00:06:27.150 --> 00:06:30.440
"Find the angle x in the diagram below."

00:06:30.920 --> 00:06:32.520
How do I do that?

00:06:38.250 --> 00:06:40.100
So this is how you do it...

00:06:41.830 --> 00:06:43.970
There's too much to learn!

00:06:44.100 --> 00:06:45.840
Damn it...

00:07:05.400 --> 00:07:06.860
Shh, okay?

00:07:06.860 --> 00:07:10.730
You can't tell anyone
Hina's hiding here!

00:07:10.730 --> 00:07:12.910
Hide-and-seek again?

00:07:13.120 --> 00:07:15.600
I'm always telling you.
Don't use my room...

00:07:17.270 --> 00:07:20.600
Puny, puny Ichigo,
where have you gone?

00:07:21.040 --> 00:07:21.670
Hey!

00:07:22.090 --> 00:07:23.040
You know...

00:07:23.270 --> 00:07:25.400
Always coming through the window!

00:07:23.350 --> 00:07:24.640
Puny human,

00:07:24.640 --> 00:07:26.380
where is Hina-Ichigo?

00:07:25.400 --> 00:07:26.380
Do something about that glass!

00:07:26.380 --> 00:07:28.410
Answer me!
Fess up, you!

00:07:29.350 --> 00:07:30.910
Suiseiseki, calm down!

00:07:31.220 --> 00:07:33.840
How can I remain calm about this?

00:07:33.840 --> 00:07:35.030
Puny, puny...

00:07:35.030 --> 00:07:36.420
I'm not puny!

00:07:41.980 --> 00:07:43.190
Found you.

00:07:44.020 --> 00:07:45.140
If you don't come out,

00:07:45.140 --> 00:07:46.660
you'll be flattened!

00:07:45.720 --> 00:07:46.660
Hey!

00:07:52.960 --> 00:07:54.400
Hina did nothing wrong!

00:07:54.680 --> 00:07:57.780
Shut up, you!
We have proof!

00:08:03.810 --> 00:08:05.500
Don't laugh!

00:08:05.500 --> 00:08:09.690
This childish graffiti that lacks
good taste must be Hina-Ichigo's!

00:08:09.690 --> 00:08:11.250
Show yours too, Souseiseki!

00:08:17.690 --> 00:08:20.500
Hina-Ichigo, did you really do this?

00:08:21.160 --> 00:08:22.260
Because...

00:08:22.490 --> 00:08:23.970
She's admitted guilt!

00:08:24.150 --> 00:08:29.410
Because she ate the soft rice cake with
strawberry I was saving for later!

00:08:29.410 --> 00:08:31.080
So this is revenge!

00:08:31.910 --> 00:08:34.810
You're still doing things like that?

00:08:35.180 --> 00:08:36.800
You're hopeless.

00:08:36.800 --> 00:08:39.250
I-It's a lie!
It's nonsense!

00:08:39.250 --> 00:08:40.310
It's the truth!

00:08:40.700 --> 00:08:45.590
Either way, you'll pay for doing this
to my precious watering can!

00:08:51.720 --> 00:08:53.420
Let it go.

00:08:53.420 --> 00:08:56.360
You guys, that's enough...

00:09:11.040 --> 00:09:11.900
Ow.

00:09:12.190 --> 00:09:14.650
Jun, how many times must I tell you?

00:09:14.820 --> 00:09:17.540
I've said that teatime is at a set time.

00:09:17.680 --> 00:09:18.670
Look...

00:09:18.670 --> 00:09:21.020
You really are a useless servant.

00:09:21.200 --> 00:09:23.920
It seems you still don't
understand your position.

00:09:24.230 --> 00:09:25.370
Hina-Ichigo,

00:09:25.370 --> 00:09:27.730
tidy up your things on the shelf.

00:09:27.470 --> 00:09:28.870
You guys...

00:09:27.730 --> 00:09:29.620
They're spilling over into my space.

00:09:30.200 --> 00:09:31.340
My goodness.

00:09:31.340 --> 00:09:33.040
Why is it wet here?

00:09:31.980 --> 00:09:33.040
You guys...

00:09:33.040 --> 00:09:33.770
You guys...

00:09:34.090 --> 00:09:35.860
Get out!

00:09:36.550 --> 00:09:39.530
It can't be...
You were the culprit?

00:09:39.530 --> 00:09:42.270
I'm sorry too, Detective Kun-kun.

00:09:43.280 --> 00:09:44.240
I love you!

00:09:45.660 --> 00:09:48.830
Oh, what a horrible woman!

00:09:48.830 --> 00:09:50.210
You needn't worry.

00:09:50.210 --> 00:09:52.350
Kun-kun won't be
deceived by such a woman.

00:09:52.800 --> 00:09:55.470
More importantly,
is the tea still not ready?

00:09:56.790 --> 00:09:59.350
Kun-kun's gonna end!

00:09:59.350 --> 00:10:00.700
I'm back!

00:10:02.260 --> 00:10:04.400
Nori, you're late!

00:10:04.400 --> 00:10:05.670
I'm sorry.

00:10:05.670 --> 00:10:08.840
We have a match coming up,
so practice ran late.

00:10:08.840 --> 00:10:09.600
To make up for it...

00:10:09.600 --> 00:10:11.170
Soft Rice Cake
With Strawberry

00:10:10.230 --> 00:10:11.170
Here.

00:10:11.690 --> 00:10:14.020
Soft rice cake with strawberry!

00:10:14.020 --> 00:10:16.210
Have it after dinner, okay?

00:10:16.210 --> 00:10:17.910
Okay! Um, um...

00:10:18.420 --> 00:10:20.910
Why don't you put it
in the pouch you got?

00:10:21.200 --> 00:10:22.900
Oh! Okay!

00:10:27.350 --> 00:10:28.780
I heard that.

00:10:28.780 --> 00:10:30.650
You're still doing that?

00:10:31.000 --> 00:10:33.380
Oh, you two are visiting?

00:10:33.550 --> 00:10:34.580
Welcome home.

00:10:34.580 --> 00:10:36.220
Oh, I'm back.

00:10:36.220 --> 00:10:37.840
Sorry for being late.

00:10:37.840 --> 00:10:39.380
I'll make dinner soon.

00:10:39.380 --> 00:10:42.080
Oh, I need to bring in the laundry.

00:10:42.080 --> 00:10:43.270
I did it.

00:10:44.110 --> 00:10:45.400
I brought it in.

00:10:46.300 --> 00:10:47.570
Jun-kun...

00:10:49.510 --> 00:10:50.910
Thank you!

00:10:51.210 --> 00:10:51.960
All right!

00:10:51.960 --> 00:10:54.770
I'll make everyone's favorite today!

00:10:54.770 --> 00:10:57.230
Nori, is it "that"?

00:10:57.230 --> 00:10:57.940
Yup!

00:10:57.940 --> 00:10:58.910
Yay!

00:10:58.910 --> 00:11:01.440
You guys stay for dinner too.

00:11:01.440 --> 00:11:03.390
Thank you so much!

00:11:03.560 --> 00:11:05.390
I'd better call Grandfather.

00:11:05.390 --> 00:11:07.320
It's that again after all.

00:11:10.530 --> 00:11:13.040
It will be night soon...

00:11:27.260 --> 00:11:30.890
Mr. Flower-topped!
Mr. Flower-topped!

00:11:30.890 --> 00:11:32.000
Smooch, smooch!

00:11:32.000 --> 00:11:35.420
Why are you so tasty?

00:11:35.420 --> 00:11:38.590
The harmony of egg and hamburger steak!

00:11:38.590 --> 00:11:40.850
When we eat it together...

00:11:44.400 --> 00:11:45.850
It's an alligator!

00:11:45.850 --> 00:11:47.160
It's an alligator!

00:11:48.150 --> 00:11:49.980
I knew she'd fall for it.

00:11:49.980 --> 00:11:51.500
Jun, thank you!

00:11:52.690 --> 00:11:55.450
Damn you, puny,
puny Ichigo and puny human!

00:11:55.450 --> 00:11:57.500
Conspiring wasn't fair!

00:11:57.890 --> 00:11:59.380
It's your own fault, right?

00:11:59.380 --> 00:12:01.110
Just forget it and eat.

00:12:01.510 --> 00:12:02.740
Your guard was down!

00:12:04.030 --> 00:12:05.300
Why you!

00:12:05.960 --> 00:12:07.420
We're even.

00:12:07.420 --> 00:12:08.470
How so?

00:12:08.470 --> 00:12:10.390
You have less now!

00:12:09.090 --> 00:12:11.530
Yay, Hina wants to eat too!

00:12:10.390 --> 00:12:11.970
It's your fault to begin with

00:12:11.970 --> 00:12:13.390
for being a glutton!

00:12:13.390 --> 00:12:15.340
You damn puny human!

00:12:15.340 --> 00:12:16.490
What's that?

00:12:16.840 --> 00:12:20.280
Well, give my regards
to Gramps and Grandma.

00:12:20.480 --> 00:12:22.670
We will.
Thank you for dinner.

00:12:22.670 --> 00:12:24.600
We'll visit again.

00:12:25.020 --> 00:12:26.830
Enter through the front door.

00:12:27.190 --> 00:12:31.600
Using strength sometimes is perfect
since you're out of shape.

00:12:31.600 --> 00:12:32.780
What?

00:12:33.590 --> 00:12:35.240
Be careful!

00:12:38.120 --> 00:12:39.480
Oh, dear.

00:12:39.780 --> 00:12:41.360
Shall we go to sleep now?

00:12:41.360 --> 00:12:42.110
Yeah.

00:12:44.430 --> 00:12:46.280
I'm going to sleep now.

00:12:46.280 --> 00:12:48.670
You're not going to bed yet, Shinku?

00:12:48.670 --> 00:12:50.520
No, not for a while.

00:12:51.080 --> 00:12:52.720
Put away your things
before going to bed.

00:12:53.020 --> 00:12:54.590
I'm sleeping with him.

00:12:54.590 --> 00:12:55.960
Good night.

00:12:56.310 --> 00:12:57.140
Good night.

00:12:57.140 --> 00:12:58.050
Good night.

00:13:18.260 --> 00:13:21.020
Oh, Shinku-chan,
you're still up?

00:13:21.220 --> 00:13:24.350
Jun-kun, I'm going to sleep now.

00:13:24.550 --> 00:13:25.490
Okay.

00:13:25.490 --> 00:13:26.520
Good night.

00:13:26.520 --> 00:13:27.670
Good night.

00:13:27.670 --> 00:13:28.850
Good night...

00:13:37.360 --> 00:13:37.940
Say...

00:13:38.650 --> 00:13:39.730
What?

00:13:39.730 --> 00:13:41.840
You've been sleeping late recently.

00:13:43.260 --> 00:13:44.240
Have I?

00:13:44.240 --> 00:13:47.610
And you used to say how time
spent sleeping was important.

00:13:54.270 --> 00:13:57.320
Well, it's quiet if it's
just you, so that's fine...

00:14:20.520 --> 00:14:21.700
You're sleeping?

00:14:21.840 --> 00:14:22.600
Yes.

00:14:22.600 --> 00:14:23.600
Good night.

00:14:23.940 --> 00:14:25.180
Good night.

00:14:30.160 --> 00:14:32.160
Say, Jun...

00:14:37.620 --> 00:14:38.770
What is it?

00:14:41.250 --> 00:14:42.730
It's nothing.

00:14:43.640 --> 00:14:44.730
Good night.

00:14:44.940 --> 00:14:45.970
Good night.

00:15:31.300 --> 00:15:32.850
Shinku...

00:15:36.840 --> 00:15:39.960
I am not junk...

00:15:40.660 --> 00:15:42.120
Not junk!

00:15:44.360 --> 00:15:48.130
Shinku, why did you do that to me...

00:15:48.760 --> 00:15:50.130
Shinku...

00:15:50.840 --> 00:15:52.220
Shinku...

00:15:53.740 --> 00:15:55.130
Shinku...

00:15:55.680 --> 00:15:56.960
Shinku...

00:15:57.280 --> 00:15:58.640
Suigintou...

00:15:59.500 --> 00:16:00.560
Wait...

00:16:01.640 --> 00:16:02.570
Wait.

00:16:02.960 --> 00:16:05.310
I didn't plan to do that.

00:16:05.310 --> 00:16:07.680
I didn't want to lose you.

00:16:07.850 --> 00:16:10.480
So I didn't take your Rosa Mystica.

00:16:10.810 --> 00:16:13.320
I... I only...

00:16:13.560 --> 00:16:18.260
Then what did you fight for?

00:16:19.560 --> 00:16:20.830
What for?

00:16:30.750 --> 00:16:31.950
Shinku...

00:16:33.330 --> 00:16:34.270
What's wrong?

00:16:37.950 --> 00:16:39.070
Jun...

00:16:45.760 --> 00:16:47.710
Do you feel a little better now?

00:16:50.850 --> 00:16:52.640
Tell me, Jun...

00:16:54.320 --> 00:16:57.280
Did I do the right thing?

00:16:59.240 --> 00:17:00.810
I turned her...

00:17:01.210 --> 00:17:03.530
I turned Suigintou into junk.

00:17:03.940 --> 00:17:06.660
That couldn't be helped, right?

00:17:06.660 --> 00:17:08.790
You even said so yourself.

00:17:09.040 --> 00:17:11.540
That the Alice Game is your fate.

00:17:11.870 --> 00:17:13.760
That you can't avoid it.

00:17:14.660 --> 00:17:18.980
Yes, I always believed that too.

00:17:19.380 --> 00:17:21.700
That it couldn't be helped.

00:17:22.890 --> 00:17:26.990
We Rozen Maidens are the dolls
that Father created.

00:17:27.400 --> 00:17:31.590
To become Alice and meet Father,
we must engage in the Alice Game

00:17:31.590 --> 00:17:35.400
and fight over each other's souls,
our Rosa Mysticas...

00:17:35.620 --> 00:17:38.600
and continue to fight
until only one remains.

00:17:39.630 --> 00:17:41.880
That is our life's purpose.

00:17:42.280 --> 00:17:43.680
That is what I believed.

00:17:44.640 --> 00:17:47.930
But having lost her,
I realized some things.

00:17:48.480 --> 00:17:51.380
Just how hard it is to lose a sister...

00:17:51.820 --> 00:17:54.260
Just how painful it is to fight...

00:17:55.420 --> 00:17:56.250
I...

00:18:01.890 --> 00:18:04.460
Shinku, you want some tea?

00:18:07.260 --> 00:18:08.760
I'll make some for you.

00:18:33.430 --> 00:18:34.380
Jun?

00:18:36.920 --> 00:18:38.090
Meimei!

00:18:38.610 --> 00:18:40.880
Suigintou's artificial spirit...

00:18:42.200 --> 00:18:44.060
Meimei? Don't go!

00:18:46.720 --> 00:18:49.250
Shinku, just now, the mirror...

00:18:52.480 --> 00:18:53.760
Shinku...

00:18:53.920 --> 00:18:55.070
It's Meimei.

00:18:55.070 --> 00:18:56.540
Meimei?

00:18:56.850 --> 00:18:57.620
Wait!

00:18:57.620 --> 00:18:58.570
Let go.

00:18:58.570 --> 00:19:01.980
There is something
I absolutely must say to her.

00:19:05.370 --> 00:19:06.580
Shinku...

00:19:16.780 --> 00:19:17.930
Ow.

00:19:18.320 --> 00:19:19.940
Damn it...

00:19:25.010 --> 00:19:25.970
It's snow.

00:19:26.300 --> 00:19:28.770
This is the handiwork
of a trickster rabbit.

00:19:29.150 --> 00:19:30.240
Rabbit?

00:19:31.080 --> 00:19:32.140
Yes.

00:19:32.140 --> 00:19:36.580
If you find my presence distasteful,
please think of it this way.

00:19:37.140 --> 00:19:41.290
That you've dozed off and
what you're seeing now is a dream.

00:19:43.770 --> 00:19:45.370
A-A rabbit...

00:19:45.370 --> 00:19:46.880
What do you want?

00:19:46.880 --> 00:19:48.520
We are in a hurry.

00:19:48.680 --> 00:19:52.260
A warning or perhaps the
lie of a charlatan...

00:19:52.640 --> 00:19:57.270
It is said that when light seeks light,
the light is lost.

00:19:57.540 --> 00:19:58.870
What's he saying?

00:19:58.870 --> 00:20:01.240
There's no point in
taking him seriously.

00:20:01.740 --> 00:20:05.480
If you wish, I will yank
out that tail of yours.

00:20:05.480 --> 00:20:10.480
The deep forest is a labyrinthine forest.
But if you insist on going...

00:20:10.940 --> 00:20:11.880
Meimei?

00:20:12.360 --> 00:20:17.310
There are countless holes in this world
and doors that hide them.

00:20:17.310 --> 00:20:19.620
Beware of doors you cannot see.

00:20:19.960 --> 00:20:22.360
For they are cunningly hidden.

00:20:29.700 --> 00:20:31.080
Well then...

00:20:32.160 --> 00:20:33.880
I bid you good day.

00:20:36.130 --> 00:20:38.540
What was with that guy?

00:21:05.550 --> 00:21:06.680
This is...

00:21:09.380 --> 00:21:10.920
Is Suigintou...

00:21:11.190 --> 00:21:12.320
No.

00:21:13.520 --> 00:21:14.370
Jun!

00:21:17.980 --> 00:21:18.610
Who's there?

00:21:20.290 --> 00:21:22.250
Who are you?
Show yourself.

00:21:37.280 --> 00:21:38.000
Who are you?

00:21:38.440 --> 00:21:39.000
Who are you?

00:21:39.660 --> 00:21:40.730
Just who are you?

00:21:41.390 --> 00:21:43.970
Just who are you?

00:21:44.460 --> 00:21:48.310
I am the fifth
Rozen Maiden doll, Shinku.

00:21:49.520 --> 00:21:50.810
Shinku...

00:21:51.100 --> 00:21:55.320
I am the seventh Rozen Maiden doll...

00:21:56.040 --> 00:21:56.820
The seventh?

00:21:59.490 --> 00:22:00.910
Bara-Suishou.

00:23:42.570 --> 00:23:44.610
Just who is that doll?

00:23:44.610 --> 00:23:47.490
Bara-Suishou, the seventh
Rozen Maiden doll.

00:23:47.490 --> 00:23:48.540
Seventh?

00:23:49.140 --> 00:23:50.550
She's suddenly started attacking!

00:23:50.550 --> 00:23:52.790
It seems she overdoes her mischief.

00:23:52.790 --> 00:23:54.250
Jun, keep hidden.

00:23:54.250 --> 00:23:55.990
You're okay alone?

00:23:55.990 --> 00:23:57.300
This is my problem.

00:23:57.650 --> 00:23:59.370
I will settle this.

00:23:59.980 --> 00:24:02.840
Next time on Rozen Maiden Träumend.

00:24:03.330 --> 00:24:05.980
Its melody is like a dream.

00:24:04.720 --> 00:24:10.910
Chapter 2
Enju
